.TH FLOW-UI.ENV 5 "November 2026" "ETL Madness FlowUI 1.3.1" "File Formats"
.SH NAME
flow-ui.env \- Environment configuration file for ETL Madness FlowUI services
.SH SYNOPSIS
.I /etc/flow-ui/flow-ui.env
(Linux and OpenBSD)
.br
.I /usr/local/etc/flow-ui/flow-ui.env
(FreeBSD)
.br
.I /opt/flow-ui/etc/flow-ui.env
(macOS)
.br
.I C:\eProgramData\eETL Madness\eFlow UI\eflow-ui.env
(Windows)
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B flow-ui.env
contains \fIKEY=VALUE\fR environment variables loaded by
.BR flow-ui (1)
via \fB\-\-env-file\fR (or \fBFLOW_UI_ENV_FILE\fR) and by OS service units.
Blank lines and lines beginning with \fB#\fR are ignored. Optional leading
\fBexport \fR prefixes and matching single or double quotes around values are
supported.
.PP
Restrict file permissions whenever credentials or TLS certificate passwords are
present (e.g., \fBchmod 0640\fR owned by \fBroot:flowui\fR on Linux/FreeBSD, or
\fBchmod 0600\fR owned by \fBroot:wheel\fR on macOS).
.SH VARIABLES
.TP
.B ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT
ASP.NET Core environment name. Recommended value: \fBProduction\fR.
.TP
.B ASPNETCORE_URLS
Explicit semicolon-separated Kestrel listen URLs (e.g.,
\fIhttp://0.0.0.0:5185\fR or \fIhttp://127.0.0.1:5185\fR behind a reverse
proxy). Takes precedence over \fBFLOW_UI_PORT\fR and \fBFLOW_UI_SCHEME\fR.
.TP
.B FLOW_UI_PORT
Listen port used when \fBASPNETCORE_URLS\fR is unset. Combined with
\fBFLOW_UI_SCHEME\fR and \fIlocalhost\fR (or \fI0.0.0.0\fR in containers).
.TP
.B FLOW_UI_SCHEME
URL scheme used with \fBFLOW_UI_PORT\fR (\fBhttps\fR by default, or \fBhttp\fR).
.TP
.B FLOW_API_URL
Full base URL of the companion \fBgo-flowAPI\fR backend (e.g.,
\fIhttp://localhost:8080\fR or \fIhttps://flow-api.internal:8080\fR). Takes
precedence over \fBFLOW_API_HOST\fR and \fBFLOW_API_PORT\fR.
.TP
.B FLOW_API_HOST
Hostname or scheme+host of \fBgo-flowAPI\fR when \fBFLOW_API_URL\fR is unset.
.TP
.B FLOW_API_PORT
Port of \fBgo-flowAPI\fR combined with \fBFLOW_API_HOST\fR.
.TP
.B FLOW_UI_AUTH_MODE
Active authentication mode: \fBApiBasic\fR (default; interactive BasicAuth
verified against \fBgo-flowAPI\fR) or \fBWindows\fR (Windows Integrated /
Active Directory identity passthrough).
.TP
.B FLOW_API_BASIC_AUTH
Optional Base64-encoded \fIuser:password\fR service token used only when
\fBFLOW_UI_AUTH_MODE=Windows\fR.
.TP
.B FLOW_UI_ADMIN_USER\fR, \fBFLOW_UI_ADMIN_PASSWORD
Optional bootstrap administrator username/password hints.
.TP
.B ASPNETCORE_Kestrel__Certificates__Default__Path\fR, \fBASPNETCORE_Kestrel__Certificates__Default__Password
Optional PKCS#12 (\fI.pfx\fR) TLS certificate path and password when binding
\fIhttps://\fR directly in Kestrel.
.SH EXAMPLE
.PP
.RS
.nf
ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT="Production"
ASPNETCORE_URLS="http://0.0.0.0:5185"
FLOW_API_URL="http://localhost:8080"
FLOW_UI_AUTH_MODE="ApiBasic"
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR flow-ui (1)
